 # json-toolkit
 
+Documentation version: 1.1 (2026-10-26)
+
 A small TypeScript library, with no runtime dependency, of building blocks for our services that store,
 exchange and update JSON: configuration files, API payloads and stored records. It is imported by the
 other projects of the team, so its behaviour must follow the published standards it implements.
 
+## JSON Patch
+
+`applyPatch(document, patch)` applies a [JSON Patch (RFC 6902)](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902)
+operation array and returns a new JSON value. It implements `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`,
+and `test`; invalid patches and failed operations throw errors. The supplied document is never mutated.
+
 ## JSON Pointer
 
 `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` resolves a [JSON Pointer (RFC 6901)](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6901)
